      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEPUNGA SHINE (1) was in the minors two back (23.09) at Richmond but ran below best last time at Wentworth Park, finishing 6th. Has ability and can bounce back. ROSA MARIE (8) was a course and distance winner (22.10) last time also from the same draw, scoring by 2.25 lengths in a NG. Has the ability and looks a key chance. MIGHTY TROJAN (2) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by half a length at Richmond Straight in a handy 17.98 beating Gambino. The form out of his last race has been franked. Will go close again if runs up to latest. IMPRESS SPIETH (6) was impressive in a dominant 20.61 win last start. Each way chance.",
